cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both of the following papers."
title: "TorchCFM: Conditional Flow Matching"
abstract: "TorchCFM is a PyTorch library for training continuous normalizing flow models with Conditional Flow Matching (CFM). It implements flow matching variants including optimal transport, Schrodinger bridge, and variance-preserving couplings, with examples for image generation, single-cell dynamics, and tabular data."
